  "uuid": "c779d47a-2829-8ba0-8272-d629b9e2902b",
  "created_at": "2026-02-22T14:35:07-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carol Peckham",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:33:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:33:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, it's Carol Peckham. I know it's Sunday and City Hall's closed, that's why I'm calling the storm line. Can you hear me okay? I've got one bar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:33:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little choppy but I've got you. What's going on, Carol?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:33:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The water. I'm at 152 Coggeshall Avenue, up the Hill, and the parking lot behind the building slopes right toward the back door. Every time it pours, it all runs down and floods the entrance. [line breaks up] ...again this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:33:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out there. Said it flooded the entrance again this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:33:56-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, again. Water right up to the door. And now it's draining off and the sidewalk out front is a sheet of mud and grit. You can't walk it without sliding. I've been tracking it inside all afternoon, I need to buy a new vacuum bag already, the old one's packed solid."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:34:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so 152 Coggeshall Avenue, back lot draining to the rear door, sidewalk covered in silt. I'm writing that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:34:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And I'm tired of calling about it. Somebody needs to look at that drain or regrade the lot or something. It's the nor'easter that came in Saturday and wrapped up today, and it does this with every decent rain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:34:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put it in as a drainage complaint for the crews to look at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:34:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do the crews work weekends? Or am I waiting till Monday for somebody to even see it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:34:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They're out on storm cleanup, so they're stretched thin right now. Priority goes to roads and flooding that's a hazard. This'll be in the queue first thing Monday at the latest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:34:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. My number's 401-555-0182 if anyone needs to call me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:35:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0182. Someone will follow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:35:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks, Kevin."
    }
  ],
